## Why This Is Asked
Testing idempotency and reliable streaming under global scale is critical for high-stakes financial and logistics systems where duplicate orders or missed events can cause significant business impact.

## Key Concepts
- Idempotency keys with Redis storage for duplicate prevention
- Exactly-once streaming using sequence IDs and consumer idempotence
- Cross-region consistency with multi-DC PostgreSQL and Kafka replication
- Fault injection testing for partial outages and latency budgets
- Contract testing for API and streaming interfaces

## Code Example
```javascript
async function testIdempotentCreate(client, orderPayload, idempotencyKey) {
  const res1 = await client.post('/orders', orderPayload, { 
    headers: { 'Idempotency-Key': idempotencyKey } 
  });
  const res2 = await client.post('/orders', orderPayload, { 
    headers: { 'Idempotency-Key': idempotencyKey } 
  });
  assert.equal(res1.status, 201);
  assert.equal(res2.status, 200);
  assert.equal(res1.body.id, res2.body.id);
}
```

